  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging Innovative Financing in Nigeria for Women in Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP has already begun work to scale up public and private finance for sustainable development in Nigeria. This includes support for Nigeria&#x2019;s Integrated National Financing Framework (INFF): Financing Strategy and the development of an SDG Investor Map. However, much of the financing work already taking place in Nigeria is focused on areas often considered less risky. There is a need to scale financing innovations to areas of the country where ongoing conflict and vulnerability to climate shocks</narrative>
  </description>
